text = "O seeker!    
Know this:      
Histories, upon [color='RED']blood[/color] mound,     
Into [color='RED']blood[/color], return.
From such decrease    
Even [color=#c0c0f0]gods[/color] are unexempt.      
Of ancient [color=#ffa000]glories[/color], you may with us partake:    
May our [color=#af8f50]cards[/color] revive them."
